<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

	<!--
		The default astrogene selection. Genes listed here get an astrogene unless the player unticks them in the mod
		settings; every other gene Starjack could build is left off until the player ticks it.
		- Entries are gene defNames. A gene that is not loaded is skipped, and MayRequire works on each entry.
		- Entries are not held to Starjack's own criteria (metabolism -1 to -5, complexity 2 or less, no archite, ...),
		  so a list can name genes Starjack would never pick by itself.
		- To extend the defaults, add another AstrogeneWhitelistDef: all loaded lists are merged. To change or replace
		  them, patch this def.
		The list is Too Many Mods' original and has not been checked against current gene mods.
	-->
